@startuml
' Figure 19.5  The agent as the query planner
' Reading order: top to bottom. The model plans one query at a time from
' what is still missing. Retrieval answers each query. Code, not the
' model, checks which parts of the question now have a passage in effect
' that states them, and code counts the queries against the budget.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Planner\n(model)" as P <<model>>
participant "Retrieval" as R <<knowledge>>
participant "Verifier and\nbudget (code)" as V <<ops>>
V -> P : open parts
P -> R : query 1
R --> V : passages
V -> V : check parts
V -> P : open parts
P -> R : query 2
R --> V : passages
V -> V : all parts verified
V --> P : stop: cite\nverified only
note right of V : at budget:\nhand off
@enduml
